---
import { trainingProgrammes, programmeVideoSearch } from '../data/trainingProgrammes';
const countTrainable = (id:string) => trainingProgrammes.find(p=>p.id===id)?.schedule.filter(d=>d.kind==='Strength'||d.kind==='Cardio').length ?? 0;
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
<meta name="theme-color" content="#101310" />
<meta name="description" content="Explore free BF GYM Global training plans for beginners, intermediate gym-goers and experienced lifters. Four-week schedules, exercises, video links, nutrition guidance and device-only progress tracking." />
<title>Free Fitness Programmes | BF GYM Global</title>
<link rel="icon" href="/bf-icon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
<link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.webmanifest" />
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/app-icon-192.png" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Oswald:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
</head>
<body>
<a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to programmes</a>
<header class="top wrap">
  <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="BF GYM Global homepage"><span>BF<b>.</b></span><strong>GYM <small>GLOBAL FITNESS</small></strong></a>
  <nav aria-label="Site navigation"><a href="/trainer/">MEET THE TRAINER</a><a href="/app/workouts/">WORKOUT VIDEOS</a><a href="/sample-plan/">MEAL PLAN DEMO</a></nav>
  <a href="/app/" class="mobile-link">OPEN APP ↗</a>
</header>
<main id="main">
<section class="hero wrap">
  <p class="eyebrow"><span class="signal" aria-hidden="true"></span> BF GYM GLOBAL / FREE FITNESS EDUCATION</p>
  <h1>FIND YOUR<br/><em>TRAINING PLAN.</em></h1>
  <p class="intro">Choose a starting level, follow a structured four-week example and explore technique demonstrations for every exercise. All programmes are free, and your completion marks stay on this device.</p>
  <div class="hero-metrics"><div><strong>03</strong><span>TRAINING LEVELS</span></div><div><strong>04</strong><span>WEEKS PER PLAN</span></div><div><strong>£0</strong><span>FREE TO EXPLORE</span></div></div>
</section>
<div class="ribbon"><span>STRENGTH</span><b aria-hidden="true">✳</b><span>CARDIO</span><b aria-hidden="true">✳</b><span>RECOVERY</span><b aria-hidden="true">✳</b><span>CONSISTENCY</span></div>
<section class="content wrap" aria-labelledby="choose-title">
 <div class="heading-row"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / YOUR STARTING POINT</p><h2 id="choose-title">PICK YOUR<br/><em>LEVEL.</em></h2></div><p>These are general examples, not individual exercise prescriptions. Choose the most manageable level rather than the hardest one.</p></div>
 <div class="level-grid" role="group" aria-label="Select a training programme">
   {trainingProgrammes.map((plan,i)=><button class:list={['level-card',{selected:i===0}]} type="button" data-plan-select={plan.id} aria-pressed={i===0?'true':'false'}>
     <span class="card-index">0{i+1} / {plan.level.toUpperCase()}</span>
     <strong>{plan.name}</strong><span class="card-desc">{plan.goal}</span>
     <span class="card-bottom"><small>{plan.duration} · {plan.sessions}</small><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
   </button>)}
 </div>
 <div class="safety"><strong>PLAN SAFETY FIRST</strong><p>Warm up, progress gradually and stop if something hurts or you feel unwell. For health conditions, recent injuries, pregnancy or unusual symptoms, get appropriate clinical advice before starting or increasing exercise. Use sensible alternatives to any unsuitable movement.</p></div>
</section>
<section class="programme-area" id="selected-plan" aria-label="Selected programme details">
 <div class="wrap">
   {trainingProgrammes.map((plan,i)=><div class="plan-panel" data-plan-panel={plan.id} hidden={i!==0}>
     <div class="heading-row programme-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / {plan.caption}</p><h2>{plan.name.toUpperCase()}<em>.</em></h2><p>{plan.description}</p></div><div class="plan-summary"><div><span>TRAINING LEVEL</span><strong>{plan.level}</strong></div><div><span>EQUIPMENT</span><strong>{plan.equipment}</strong></div><div><span>TIME FRAME</span><strong>{plan.duration}</strong></div></div></div>
     <div class="weeks"><div><strong>YOUR FOUR-WEEK PROGRESSION</strong><p>Use the weekly note to adjust the same movement routine gradually.</p></div>
       <div class="week-buttons" role="group" aria-label={'Choose a week for '+plan.name}>
         {[1,2,3,4].map(week=><button type="button" data-plan-week={plan.id} data-week={week} aria-pressed={week===1?'true':'false'} class:list={['week',{active:week===1}]}><span>WEEK</span><strong>{week}</strong></button>)}
       </div>
     </div>
     <div class="weekly-advice"><span>THIS WEEK'S FOCUS</span><p data-week-tip={plan.id}>{plan.weeks[0]}</p></div>
     <div class="progress-row">
       <div><strong>YOUR PERSONAL PROGRESS</strong><p><span data-completed={plan.id}>0</span> of {countTrainable(plan.id)} training days completed in this selected week</p><div class="meter" role="progressbar" aria-label={plan.name+' weekly session completion'} aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax={countTrainable(plan.id)} aria-valuenow="0" data-progress={plan.id}><div class="meter-fill"></div></div></div>
       <button class="clear-progress" type="button" data-clear-plan={plan.id}>RESET THIS WEEK</button>
     </div>
     <div class="schedule-label"><h3>YOUR WEEKLY TRAINING</h3><p>Select each day for exercises and demonstration links. Rest days are included, but don't count toward the training-day total.</p></div>
     <div class="schedule-grid">
       {plan.schedule.map((day,dayIndex)=><article class="day" data-kind={day.kind}>
         <div class="day-head"><div><span class="day-index">{String(dayIndex+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><span class="day-name">{day.day.toUpperCase()}</span></div><span class="day-type">{day.kind.toUpperCase()}</span></div>
         <h4>{day.label}</h4><p class="duration">⏱ {day.time}</p>
         <details class="exercise-details" open={dayIndex===0}>
           <summary>{day.exercises.length ? 'VIEW '+day.exercises.length+' ACTIVITIES' : 'RECOVERY NOTES'}</summary>
           {day.exercises.length ? <ul>{day.exercises.map(exercise=><li>
              <div><strong>{exercise.name}</strong><span>{exercise.volume}</span></div>
              <p>{exercise.tip}</p>
              <a href={programmeVideoSearch(exercise.name)} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">FIND YOUTUBE DEMOS <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
           </li>)}</ul> : <p class="rest-text">Take a restful day or only gentle movement, depending on how you feel.</p>}
           {day.notes && <p class="day-note">{day.notes}</p>}
         </details>
         {day.kind==='Strength'||day.kind==='Cardio' ? <button type="button" class="done" data-plan-day={plan.id} data-day={day.day} aria-pressed="false"><span class="check" aria-hidden="true">○</span> MARK COMPLETE</button> : <span class="day-rest">RECOVERY / OPTIONAL</span>}
       </article>)}
     </div>
     <div class="guidance-grid">
       <div class="guidance"><p class="eyebrow">03 / TRAIN SMART</p><h3>TRAINING NOTES</h3><ul>{plan.notes.map(note=><li>{note}</li>)}</ul></div>
       <div class="guidance"><p class="eyebrow">04 / EAT WELL</p><h3>NUTRITION BASICS</h3><ul>{plan.nutrition.map(note=><li>{note}</li>)}</ul><p class="guidance-fine">No calorie prescription or medical dietary assessment is provided.</p></div>
     </div>
     <div class="resource-row"><a href="/app/workouts/" class="resource-link">FIND MORE EXERCISE DEMOS <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="/sample-plan/" class="resource-link">VIEW A SAMPLE DAY OF MEALS <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><button type="button" class="resource-link print" onclick="window.print()">PRINT SELECTED PLAN <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></div>
   </div>)}
 </div>
</section>
<section class="notes-section wrap">
 <p class="eyebrow">05 / EVIDENCE &amp; GENERAL GUIDANCE</p>
 <h2>MAKE MOVEMENT<br/><em>A HABIT.</em></h2>
 <div class="notes-grid">
   <p>The UK Chief Medical Officers recommend that most adults work towards at least 150 minutes of moderate activity per week (or 75 minutes vigorous), plus muscle strengthening on at least two days. Start with what you can manage and build gradually.</p>
   <p>The NHS Eatwell Guide recommends variety and balance across food groups. Individual energy needs are different, so this site deliberately does not set a one-size-fits-all calorie target.</p>
 </div>
 <div class="source-links"><a href="https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/physical-activity-guidelines-adults-and-older-adults/physical-activity-for-adults-and-older-adults-19-and-over-text-of-the-infographic" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">UK ACTIVITY GUIDANCE ↗</a><a href="https://www.nhs.uk/live-well/eat-well/food-guidelines-and-food-labels/the-eatwell-guide/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">NHS EATWELL GUIDE ↗</a></div>
 <p class="privacy">Your selected level, week and completed-day marks are stored only in this browser's local storage. They are not synced to an account and can be lost if browser data is cleared. This site does not collect personal health details from this feature. YouTube links open third-party search results; individual videos are not endorsed or verified by BF GYM Global.</p>
</section>
<section class="cta wrap"><div><p class="eyebrow">BF GYM / TRAIN WITH PURPOSE</p><h2>KEEP SHOWING UP.<br/><em>ONE WEEK AT A TIME.</em></h2><p>All free. No sales, membership or coach booking required.</p></div><div><a href="/app/" class="cta-button">OPEN MOBILE FITNESS APP ↗</a><a href="/trainer/" class="cta-text">MEET COACH ADEEP ↗</a></div></section>
</main>
<footer class="footer wrap"><a href="/">BF<span>.</span> GYM GLOBAL</a><div><a href="/trainer/">Trainer</a><a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a><a href="/app/">Mobile app</a></div></footer>
<script>
 const panels=Array.from(document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-plan-panel]'));
 const selectors=Array.from(document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-plan-select]'));
 const tips:Record<string,string[]>={
   beginner:["Week 1 · Learn movements. Start with 1–2 sets and short walks.","Week 2 · Aim for 2 sets. Increase walking by a few minutes if comfortable.","Week 3 · Repeat controlled movements; add a set or a little time only if ready.","Week 4 · Practise consistency. Review what felt manageable and what to adjust."],
   intermediate:["Week 1 · Choose manageable weights and learn consistent technique.","Week 2 · Add a small number of repetitions if sets feel controlled.","Week 3 · Progress a load modestly or add one set to selected movements, not both.","Week 4 · Reduce volume if fatigue builds; reflect on form and consistency."],
   advanced:["Week 1 · Establish sustainable training loads; note technique and energy levels.","Week 2 · Progress a rep on selected movements while keeping good form.","Week 3 · Add a small load increase only where consistent technique permits.","Week 4 · Use an easier volume week if fatigue accumulates. Review training response."]
 };
 const key='bf-gym-training-programme-progress-v1';
 let saved:Record<string,boolean>={};
 try{const value=localStorage.getItem(key);const parsed=value?JSON.parse(value):{};if(parsed && typeof parsed==='object' && !Array.isArray(parsed)){for(const [k,v] of Object.entries(parsed)){if(typeof v==='boolean')saved[k]=v;}}}catch{/* Browsing in privacy mode may prevent storage. */}
 let selected='beginner';
 const weeks:Record<string,number>={beginner:1,intermediate:1,advanced:1};
 function save(){try{localStorage.setItem(key,JSON.stringify(saved));}catch{/* Interactive state lasts for this tab only. */}}
 function renderPlan(plan:string){
   const panel=panels.find(p=>p.dataset.planPanel===plan);if(!panel)return;
   const week=weeks[plan]||1;const progressKey=plan+':'+week+':';
   const btns=Array.from(panel.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-plan-day]'));
   let complete=0;
   for(const btn of btns){
     const done=Boolean(saved[progressKey+btn.dataset.day]);
     btn.classList.toggle('completed',done);btn.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(done));
     btn.innerHTML=done?'<span class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span> COMPLETED':'<span class="check" aria-hidden="true">○</span> MARK COMPLETE';
     if(done)complete++;
   }
   const counter=panel.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-completed]');if(counter)counter.textContent=String(complete);
   const bar=panel.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-progress]');
   if(bar){bar.setAttribute('aria-valuenow',String(complete));const fill=bar.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.meter-fill');if(fill)fill.style.width=(btns.length?100*complete/btns.length:0)+'%';}
   const tip=panel.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-week-tip]');if(tip)tip.textContent=tips[plan]?.[week-1]||'';
   panel.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-plan-week]').forEach(b=>{
     const active=Number(b.dataset.week)===week;
     b.classList.toggle('active',active);b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(active));
   });
 }
 selectors.forEach(btn=>btn.addEventListener('click',()=>{
   const next=btn.dataset.planSelect||'beginner';selected=next;
   selectors.forEach(b=>{const active=b===btn;b.classList.toggle('selected',active);b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(active));});
   panels.forEach(p=>{p.hidden=p.dataset.planPanel!==selected;});
   renderPlan(selected);
   document.getElementById('selected-plan')?.scrollIntoView({behavior:window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches?'instant':'smooth',block:'start'});
 }));
 document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-plan-week]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{
   const plan=b.dataset.planWeek||'beginner';weeks[plan]=Number(b.dataset.week)||1;renderPlan(plan);
 }));
 document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-plan-day]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{
   const plan=b.dataset.planDay||'beginner',day=b.dataset.day||'';
   const id=plan+':'+weeks[plan]+':'+day;
   saved[id]=!saved[id];save();renderPlan(plan);
 }));
 document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-clear-plan]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{
   const plan=b.dataset.clearPlan||'beginner',prefix=plan+':'+weeks[plan]+':';
   if(!window.confirm('Clear your completion marks for the selected week?'))return;
   Object.keys(saved).filter(k=>k.startsWith(prefix)).forEach(k=>{delete saved[k];});save();renderPlan(plan);
 }));
 panels.forEach(p=>renderPlan(p.dataset.planPanel||'beginner'));
</script>
</body>
</html>
<style is:global>
:root{--bg:#101310;--surface:#1c271b;--surface2:#29382a;--lime:#c7ff52;--cream:#f1f4e9;--muted:#b7c5b1;--line:#4c6345;--display:Oswald,Impact,Arial,sans-serif;--body:'DM Sans',Arial,sans-serif}
*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:20px}body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--cream);font:14px/1.6 var(--body);margin:0}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}button{cursor:pointer;font:inherit}a:focus-visible,button:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--lime);outline-offset:3px}[hidden]{display:none!important}.wrap{width:min(1220px,calc(100% - 40px));margin-inline:auto}.skip{position:absolute;left:10px;top:-100px;padding:12px;background:var(--lime);color:#1b2c16;z-index:10}.skip:focus{top:10px}h1,h2,h3,h4,p{margin-top:0}h1,h2,h3,h4{font-family:var(--display);text-transform:uppercase}em{color:var(--lime);font-style:normal}
.top{min-height:82px;border-bottom:1px solid #465841;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:20px}.brand{display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:center}.brand>span{font:700 35px/.9 var(--display)}.brand b,.footer>a span{color:var(--lime)}.brand strong{font-size:14px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.13em}.brand small{display:block;font-size:9px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6}.top nav{display:flex;gap:21px}.top nav a,.mobile-link{font-size:10px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.06em}.top nav a:hover{color:var(--lime)}.mobile-link{padding:13px;border:1px solid var(--lime)}
.hero{padding-top:85px;padding-bottom:60px}.eyebrow{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;font-weight:900;color:var(--lime)}.signal{display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:var(--lime);border-radius:50%;margin-right:8px}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(70px,9vw,130px);line-height:.96;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:27px 0}.intro{color:#c7d7be;max-width:750px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.85}.hero-metrics{display:flex;gap:40px;align-items:center;margin-top:35px}.hero-metrics>div{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}.hero-metrics strong{font:700 38px var(--display);color:var(--lime)}.hero-metrics span{font-size:10px;max-width:95px;color:#c3d1bd;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em}.ribbon{background:var(--lime);color:#182613;display:flex;justify-content:space-around;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:17px;font:700 clamp(16px,2vw,25px) var(--display)}.ribbon b{font:800 16px var(--body)}
.content,.notes-section{padding-top:90px;padding-bottom:95px}.heading-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:55px}.heading-row h2,.notes-section h2,.cta h2{font-size:clamp(53px,6vw,83px);font-weight:600;line-height:1.01;margin:15px 0}.heading-row>p{max-width:380px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:16px}.level-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:13px;margin-top:37px}.level-card{min-height:255px;text-align:left;padding:25px 22px;background:#202d1f;border:1px solid #526e47;color:var(--cream);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;transition:background .15s}.level-card.selected{background:var(--lime);border-color:var(--lime);color:#1c2c15}.card-index{font-size:10px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--lime)}.level-card.selected .card-index{color:#2b4a18}.level-card>strong{font:700 39px/1 var(--display);text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:16px}.card-desc{font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;opacity:.9}.card-bottom{margin-top:auto;border-top:1px solid #7e967256;padding-top:17px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;width:100%;gap:10px}.card-bottom small{font-size:10px}.card-bottom>span{font-size:22px}.safety{display:flex;gap:20px;padding:19px 22px;border-left:3px solid var(--lime);background:#253525;margin-top:24px}.safety strong{color:var(--lime);font-size:11px;white-space:nowrap}.safety p{color:#d0deca;margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.8}
.programme-area{background:#192319;padding:80px 0 105px}.programme-title>div:first-child>p:last-child{max-width:590px;font-size:13px;color:#c3d2bd;line-height:1.85}.plan-summary{display:grid;gap:12px;min-width:265px;max-width:340px}.plan-summary>div{border-left:2px solid var(--lime);padding:4px 0 4px 15px}.plan-summary span{font-size:9px;color:#b8ccb0;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.1em;display:block}.plan-summary strong{font-size:12px;line-height:1.6}.weeks{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:20px;margin-top:55px;padding:24px;background:#29392a;border:1px solid #526c4c}.weeks strong{font-size:12px}.weeks p{font-size:11px;color:#c1d2b8;max-width:320px;margin:8px 0 0}.week-buttons{display:flex;gap:8px}.week{padding:11px 16px;min-width:65px;background:#1b281b;border:1px solid #5a7750;color:#c8d9c0;display:grid;gap:3px;text-align:center}.week span{font-size:9px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.09em}.week strong{font:700 25px/1 var(--display)}.week.active{background:var(--lime);color:#1a2b15;border-color:var(--lime)}
.weekly-advice{padding:17px 22px;border:1px solid #3b5438;border-top:0;background:#223022}.weekly-advice span{font-size:10px;font-weight:900;color:var(--lime);letter-spacing:.1em}.weekly-advice p{color:#d3e3ca;margin:8px 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.8}
.progress-row{margin-top:28px;background:#253324;border:1px solid #506748;padding:21px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:22px}.progress-row>div{flex:1}.progress-row strong{font-size:11px;color:#dceace;letter-spacing:.07em}.progress-row p{font-size:12px;color:#c3d6bb;margin:7px 0 12px}.meter{width:100%;height:7px;background:#142315;overflow:hidden}.meter-fill{background:var(--lime);height:100%;width:0;transition:width .2s}.clear-progress{background:none;border:1px solid #718b67;color:#e1f0d8;padding:12px;font-size:10px;font-weight:900;white-space:nowrap}
.schedule-label{margin:60px 0 23px;display:flex;align-items:end;justify-content:space-between;gap:25px}.schedule-label h3{font:700 36px var(--display);margin:0}.schedule-label p{max-width:450px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin:0}
.schedule-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px}.day{background:#263427;border:1px solid #486643;padding:22px;min-width:0}.day[data-kind="Rest"],.day[data-kind="Recovery"]{background:#1e2c20}.day-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:13px;align-items:center}.day-head>div{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}.day-index{color:#7c9873;font:700 27px var(--display)}.day-name{color:var(--lime);font-size:11px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.09em}.day-type{color:#bdd2b4;border:1px solid #58704f;padding:5px 8px;font-size:9px;font-weight:800}.day h4{font:600 32px/1.1 var(--display);margin:18px 0 5px}.duration{font-size:11px;color:#afc1a7}.exercise-details{border-top:1px solid #425b3d;margin-top:16px}.exercise-details summary{font-size:10px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--lime);font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.1em;padding:16px 0}.exercise-details ul{padding:0;margin:0;list-style:none}.exercise-details li{border-top:1px solid #3a5437;padding:14px 0}.exercise-details li>div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:start;gap:10px}.exercise-details li strong{font-size:13px;line-height:1.3}.exercise-details li>div span{color:#e5f0dc;white-space:nowrap;font-size:11px;font-weight:800}.exercise-details li p,.rest-text{color:#b9cbb3;font-size:11px;margin:7px 0 9px;line-height:1.7}.exercise-details li a{color:var(--lime);font-size:10px;font-weight:900}.day-note{font-size:11px;color:#c9dac1;line-height:1.8;border-left:2px solid var(--lime);padding:5px 11px;margin-top:10px}.done{width:100%;background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--lime);padding:13px;color:var(--lime);font-size:10px;font-weight:900;margin-top:15px}.done.completed{background:var(--lime);color:#172515}.check{font-size:14px;margin-right:6px}.day-rest{display:block;font-size:10px;color:#aabea1;letter-spacing:.08em;margin-top:16px}
.guidance-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:17px;margin-top:38px}.guidance{background:#253525;border:1px solid #4a6443;padding:27px}.guidance h3{font:700 33px var(--display);margin:13px 0}.guidance ul{padding-left:20px;color:#c6d9bc;line-height:1.9;font-size:12px}.guidance li{margin:10px 0}.guidance li::marker{color:var(--lime)}.guidance-fine{font-size:11px;color:#abbfa4}.resource-row{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:18px;flex-wrap:wrap}.resource-link{background:transparent;border:1px solid #72916a;padding:14px 16px;font-size:10px;color:#d5eccb;font-weight:900;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px}.resource-link span{color:var(--lime);font-size:15px}
